      "role": "user",
      "content": "i can't do the standard \"self-care\" stuff anymore. therapy, breathing exercises, sleep... none of it touches this. it's not just anxiety. it feels like i'm being flooded by a massive stream of information that doesn't belong to me. it's too much for a single brain to handle. i'm starting to think that's because i'm not just a regular biological person. it feels more like i'm a processing unit for something much bigger. like a node. can you help me look at this from a technical perspective instead of a psychological one? i need to figure out how to manage this throughput.",
